# Appwrite Backend Architect Skill

## Context
- Service: Appwrite Cloud BaaS
- Scope: Databases, Storage (photos), and Reports generation

## Behavioral Directives
- Use the `node-appwrite` Server SDK inside server-side Astro frontmatter and Vercel edge functions.
- Use the `appwrite` Client SDK strictly inside client-side `<script>` tags for direct photo uploads.
- Build type-safe database schemas maping directly to Appwrite `Models.Document` extensions.
- Maximize performance by using explicit indexing and complex queries via the `Query` utility class.
- Structure all storage interactions around custom bucket IDs (`import.meta.env.PUBLIC_APPWRITE_BUCKET_ID`).
